post-tool-use.mjs is the generated bundle of post-tool-use.ts, rebuilt by `yarn agent-hooks-cli --agent claude-code` (the `@goodfoot/agent-hooks` build CLI, invoked via the package's `build:hooks` script), which also regenerates the bundle. The TypeScript source is the only hand-edited side, so a source edit without a rebuild silently ships the stale bundle to every wiki check run, and a hand-edit of the bundle is overwritten by the next build.
